window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sabrina Winters</p> <p>I've turned into a shell of myself after something happened to me, something I can't face.</p> <p>But when my father owes the Most Dangerous Man in New York, he only has one bargaining chip—<i>Me</i>.</p> <p>I can feel the safe haven I've built crashing down around me as I stand face to face with the leader of the criminal underground—my future husband. Now I must navigate this unwanted marriage of convenience while never revealing the truth about myself or my past. Will all my efforts to rebuild myself be eradicated, or could there be more to him than I ever dreamed possible or will my past come back to haunt me and tear us apart?</p>"; 
